{
  "_about": "Thresholds and word lists for fv.py rf lint (spec 5.5). Defaults to tune: edit freely. Matching is case-insensitive and a word also matches its plural. Where a rule looks for things that must not appear, words after no, not, never, without, avoid or ignore are skipped up to the end of that sentence (or the next ; or :). C1 counts the clean-frame terms only inside such a negated clause.",
  "negation_cues": ["no", "not", "never", "without", "avoid", "ignore"],
  "prompt_blocks": ["GOAL", "REFERENCES", "CAST", "ACTION", "CAMERA", "SOUND", "CONTINUITY", "LOOK", "AUDIO", "EXCLUSIONS", "RHYTHM", "TONE", "LIGHTING", "TEXTURE"],
